  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Action will provide a crucial contribution to enhancing the resilience and further reform of healthcare, contributing to social inclusion and cohesive development. This will be achieved through investing in structures for detecting and responding to epidemiological hazards, developing capacities of healthcare institutions at all levels of care provision.</narrative>
